<%# locals: (title:) %>
<%# Fulas Bank: a block of a movement's detail that is always in sight (the
    sketch's «Detalles», «Cómo cuenta», «Similares»...): its title over its
    content, no arrow to fold it. Used as a layout: render layout: ... do. %>
<section class="space-y-2">
  <h3 class="px-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase text-secondary"><%= title %></h3>
  <%= yield %>
</section>
